card.statement:
The polynomials $P_n=P_{-2,n}$ satisfy the following fourth order linear differential equation

\begin{align}
&16 ( c^2-1)^2   P_{n}^{(iv)}+160 c  (c^2-1 )  P_{n}'''    -8  (c^2  (n^2-4 n-42 )-n^2+4 n+18 )P_{n}''    \\
&\quad -24 c   (n^2-4 n-2 )P_{n}'  +(n-6) (n-2)^2   (n+2)P_{n}=0 .   \notag
\end{align}
